<title>ISRAEL: PLO's Arafat to meet Mubarak in Cairo.</title>
<headline>PLO's Arafat to meet Mubarak in Cairo.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat will travel to Cairo on Wednesday to brief Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak on negotiations over an Israeli troop redeployment in the West Bank town of Hebron, a PLO official said.</p>
<p>Arafat, who hosted Jordan's King Hussein in the West Bank on Tuesday, said negotiations had yielded no progress.</p>
<p>Israeli officials said the sides were close to agreement.</p>
<p>U.S.-brokered peace talks were due to resume on Wednesday in Egypt's Red Sea resort of Taba.</p>
</text>
